@startuml wal-record
' ============================================================================
' wal-record.puml — the 17-byte WAL record frame + the 15 record types.
' Source of truth: src/persistent_artrie/core/wal/codec.rs
'   (RECORD_HEADER_SIZE = 17; WalRecordType, 15 discriminants).
' Drawn as a CONTIGUOUS colored byte table (offset column + field column) hosted in
' a floating note; the 15 WalRecordType discriminants are preserved as a text block
' inside the same note, below the table. Full-cell color via Creole |<#hex>| cells.
' Color key: purple integrity (CRC) · amber length · orange LSN (WAL) ·
'            teal type · blue payload
' ============================================================================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam TitleFontSize 15
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #37474F
}

title WAL record — 17-byte header + type-specific payload

note as WR
|= bytes |= field |
|<#E1BEE7> 0..3 |<#E1BEE7> crc32  (over length · lsn · type · payload) |
|<#FFE0B2> 4..7 |<#FFE0B2> length  (payload byte count) |
|<#FFCC80> 8..15 |<#FFCC80> lsn  (u64 log-sequence number) |
|<#B2DFDB> 16 |<#B2DFDB> type  (1 of 15 WalRecordType) |
|<#BBDEFB> 17.. |<#BBDEFB> payload  (type-specific) |

**15 WalRecordType discriminants**
1 Insert · 2 Remove · 3 Checkpoint · 4 BeginTx · 5 CommitTx
6 AbortTx · 7 Increment · 8 Upsert · 9 CompareAndSwap
10 BatchInsert · 11 BatchIncrement · 12 VersionUpdate
13 VersionDurable · 14 VersionGc · 15 CommitRank
end note

legend bottom
| Color | Field |
|<#E1BEE7>| CRC-32 integrity |
|<#FFE0B2>| length |
|<#FFCC80>| LSN (log-sequence number) |
|<#B2DFDB>| record type |
|<#BBDEFB>| payload |
endlegend
@enduml
